        "text": "Brennan Joinery Ltd was contracted by Castlegate to fit kitchens and staircases in 30 new townhouses for \u00a3150,000, to be completed by June 30, 2025",
        "citations": [
          "F1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Castlegate's contract with the developer contains a liquidated damages clause of \u00a35,000 per day for late completion",
        "citations": [
          "F2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "By April 2025 Brennan had completed 12 houses and indicated financial difficulties and possible failure to finish the job",
        "citations": [
          "F3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On 14 April 2025 Castlegate promised to pay Brennan an extra \u00a31,000 per remaining house completed on time to avoid penalties",
        "citations": [
          "F4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Brennan completed the remaining 18 houses by the deadline, but Castlegate only paid the original contract price and refused the extra \u00a318,000",
        "citations": [
          "F5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "There was no threat or pressure from Brennan to obtain Castlegate\u2019s promise; the offer of extra payment came solely from Castlegate",
        "citations": [
          "F6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Brennan seeks to recover the \u00a318,000 promised in extra payment",
        "citations": [
